## 3. DISPOSITIONS (accepted unless marked OPEN; seat positions by answer-file:line)

A1 DECODE: `lba` = bit 6 (`WDSD_LBA`), drive bit 4, head bits 3-0 unchanged.  All seven.  ACCEPTED.
A2 READBACK MECHANISM -- see D1.
