## Q2

**Q2(a).** Grades, with the rule:

| cell | grade | why |
|---|---|---|
| C1, C2, C3, C4, C8, C12, C13, C15, C16, C18 | rowed | witness rows. C18 carries the �?oword 49 unchanged�?? claim |
