R5 does not move C5 to (e). R5 limits case-splits the body does not have. V4 is a weakening of the new guard (R3), and V8 deletes a term the body reads. No cell is missing inside the function boundary. Caller predicates (`diskimage_exist`, the switch arm) stop at that boundary (R4). The drafter�?Ts list of dominating predicates is complete.

