**Q2(c).** Wants I re-walked match the table: `TAG(67)=0xffbc0043`, `TAG(5)=0xfffa0005`, `TAG(69)=0xffba0045`, `TAG(70)=0xffb90046`, `TAG(256)=0xfeff0100`, `TAG(1007)=0xfc1003ef`, `TAG(10)=0xfff5000a`, payload combines as stated. CHS indices 67, 9, 256, 1007 and the valid triples `(0xa1, sector 8)` = index 70 and `(0xa1, sector 7)` = index 69 are right. N5�?Ts `0xa4/sector 5` is index 256 and `0xaf/sector 63` is index 1007.

* **P10.** Use N7. The model has no sector-range check (READ; nothing compares `sector` with `sectors_per_track`), and the witness�?Ts sector 71/70 measurement matches index 70/69. The shipped stimulus should be a triple ATA-2 defines.
* **P11.** Make `lba 0`�?Ts HEAD want the literal `0x00000000`, both columns `eq`. `nehead` also passes an empty-ring read.
* **P13.** N4 is owed. `0xe5` and `0xb3` both have bits 7 and 5 set.
